---
import Eyebrow from "./Eyebrow.astro";
import Portrait from "./Portrait.astro";
---

<section class="section night">
  <div class="container-x grid-12">
    <div class="who"><Portrait /></div>
    <div class="note">
      <Eyebrow>Who you’ll work with</Eyebrow>
      <h2>One person. <em>Start to finish.</em></h2>
      <p class="body">I’m Pep Dekker. For 18 years I built lead generation and marketing systems for small businesses. Now I install Claude inside freight offices. I’m not a freight veteran, so I start every engagement by watching your reps work and measuring what actually eats their day. You work with me directly, from the first call to handover.</p>
      <a class="link link-block more" href="/about/">About →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .body { margin-top: 28px; max-width: 60ch; }
  .more { margin-top: 24px; }
  @media (min-width: 900px) {
    .who { grid-column: 1 / span 4; }
    .note { grid-column: 6 / span 7; align-self: center; }
  }
</style>
